#: ../developer/provider-adapters.md:1
msgid "Writing a Provider Adapter"
msgstr "编写 provider adapter"

#: ../developer/provider-adapters.md:3
msgid ""
"This page is for contributors adding support for a provider the gateway "
"cannot talk to yet. To serve another model from a provider the gateway "
"already supports, you need no code at all; see [Adding a New Model"
"](adding-models.md)."
msgstr ""
"本页面向要给网关接入新 provider 的贡献者。如果只是想用网关已经支持的 provider 再提供一个模型，完全不用写代码；见[添加新模型"
"](adding-models.md)。"

#: ../developer/provider-adapters.md:7
msgid ""
"Most providers do not need a new adapter either. If the API is OpenAI-"
"compatible, a profile and a few lines in `registry.py` are enough, as "
"Step 1 shows. A dedicated adapter is only for a provider with its own "
"wire format."
msgstr ""
"大多数 provider 也不需要新写 adapter。如果 API 兼容 OpenAI，一个 profile 加上 `registry.py` "
"里的几行改动就够了，见第 1 步。只有协议格式自成一套的 provider，才需要专门的 adapter。"

#: ../developer/provider-adapters.md:11
msgid "Step 1: decide whether you need an adapter at all"
msgstr "第 1 步：先判断到底需不需要 adapter"

#: ../developer/provider-adapters.md:13
msgid ""
"Most new providers expose an OpenAI-style `/chat/completions` endpoint. "
"For those, **do not write an adapter class.** Register a provider "
"profile, then add two things to `_make_adapter` in "
"`apps/backend/serving/servers/registry.py`: an arm that selects the "
"profile, and the kind in the OpenAI-compatible tuple further down the "
"same function:"
msgstr ""
"大多数新 provider 都提供 OpenAI 风格的 `/chat/completions` 端点。对这类 provider，**不要写 "
"adapter 类**。先注册一个 provider profile，再在 "
"`apps/backend/serving/servers/registry.py` 的 `_make_adapter` "
"里改两处：一是加一个选中该 profile 的分支，二是在同一函数靠后的 OpenAI 兼容元组里加上这个 kind："

#: ../developer/provider-adapters.md:43
msgid ""
"Add the kind to `RESERVED_PROVIDER_LABELS` in the same module as well, so"
" that no route can borrow it as a label of its own; a unit test fails if "
"a dispatchable kind is missing from that set."
msgstr ""
"还要把这个 kind 加进同一模块的 `RESERVED_PROVIDER_LABELS`，防止路由把它拿去当自己的标签；如果可分派的 kind "
"没有加进这个集合，单元测试会失败。"

#: ../developer/provider-adapters.md:47
msgid ""
"This is how `deepseek`, `zai`, `kimi`, and `minimax` are integrated "
"today: a per-provider profile in "
"`apps/backend/serving/adapters/profiles.py` carries the usage-metric or "
"path quirks, and `OpenAICompatAdapter` does the rest."
msgstr ""
"`deepseek`、`zai`、`kimi` 和 `minimax` 目前都是这样接入的：每个 provider 在 "
"`apps/backend/serving/adapters/profiles.py` 里有一份 "
"profile，记录用量指标或路径上的特殊处理，其余都交给 `OpenAICompatAdapter`。"

#: ../developer/provider-adapters.md:51
msgid ""
"Write a dedicated adapter only when the provider speaks a genuinely non-"
"OpenAI wire format — Gemini's `generateContent`, the Anthropic Messages "
"API, OpenRouter's provider-pinning body fields. `gemini`, `claude`, "
"`anthropic`, and `openrouter` all follow that pattern, each with its own "
"dispatch branch:"
msgstr ""
"只有 provider 用的确实不是 OpenAI 的协议格式时，才需要写专门的 adapter，例如 Gemini 的 "
"`generateContent`、Anthropic Messages API，以及 OpenRouter 用来锁定 sub-provider "
"的请求体字段。`gemini`、`claude`、`anthropic` 和 `openrouter` 都是这种情况，各自有独立的分派分支："

#: ../developer/provider-adapters.md:61
msgid "Step 2: write the adapter (custom protocols only)"
msgstr "第 2 步：编写 adapter（仅限自定义协议）"

#: ../developer/provider-adapters.md:63
msgid ""
"Create a new file under `apps/backend/serving/adapters/`, for example "
"`apps/backend/serving/adapters/your_provider.py`. The backend package "
"root is `apps/backend`, so imports are written as `serving.…` / "
"`routing.…`:"
msgstr ""
"在 `apps/backend/serving/adapters/` 下新建一个文件，例如 "
"`apps/backend/serving/adapters/your_provider.py`。后端的包根目录是 "
"`apps/backend`，因此 import 写成 `serving.…` / `routing.…`："

#: ../developer/provider-adapters.md:218
msgid "Export it from `apps/backend/serving/adapters/__init__.py`:"
msgstr "在 `apps/backend/serving/adapters/__init__.py` 里导出它："

#: ../developer/provider-adapters.md:229
msgid "and import it at the top of `apps/backend/serving/servers/registry.py`:"
msgstr "并在 `apps/backend/serving/servers/registry.py` 顶部导入它："

#: ../developer/provider-adapters.md:238
msgid "Step 3: add the model to your registry"
msgstr "第 3 步：把模型加进注册表"

#: ../developer/provider-adapters.md:271
msgid "Step 4: configure environment variables"
msgstr "第 4 步：配置环境变量"

#: ../developer/provider-adapters.md:273
msgid "Add to `.env`:"
msgstr "加进 `.env`："

#: ../developer/provider-adapters.md:280
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"A route whose `${VAR}`-backed `api_key`, `api_keys`, or `base_url` "
"resolves to empty is not registered. By default that drops the whole "
"model, and the backend logs which models were skipped and which variables"
" were unset. Mark a route `optional: true` to have only that route be "
"skipped instead, leaving the rest of the model registered."
msgstr ""
"如果某条路由的 `api_key`、`api_keys` 或 `base_url` 引用的 `${VAR}` "
"解析为空，这条路由就不会注册。默认情况下整个模型都会被丢弃，后端日志会写明跳过了哪些模型、哪些变量没设置。给路由加上 `optional: "
"true`，就只跳过这一条路由，模型的其他路由照常注册。"

#: ../developer/provider-adapters.md:286
msgid "Step 5: verify it"
msgstr "第 5 步：验证"

#: ../developer/provider-adapters.md:288
msgid ""
"Start the gateway with a registry that uses the new kind, then check it "
"as described in [Verify it through the gateway](adding-models.md#verify-"
"it-through-the-gateway)."
msgstr ""
"用包含新 kind 的注册表启动网关，再按[通过网关验证](adding-models.md#verify-it-through-the-"
"gateway)里的方法检查。"

#: ../developer/provider-adapters.md:291
msgid "Deployment-local adapters"
msgstr "部署自带的 adapter"

#: ../developer/provider-adapters.md:293
msgid ""
"A deployment can register a local factory without editing the built-in "
"dispatch. Its module exposes a synchronous, no-argument `register()` "
"function:"
msgstr "部署可以注册自己的 adapter 工厂，不用改内置的分派逻辑。做法是在一个模块里提供一个同步、无参数的 `register()` 函数："

#: ../developer/provider-adapters.md:309
msgid ""
"Set `BACKEND_EXTENSIONS` to this module's import name and use `kind: "
"example_service` in the model registry. The factory receives the route's "
"configuration dictionary and returns an adapter. It runs before built-in "
"provider defaults, so it must supply any profile or path defaults it "
"needs. Duplicate registrations fail; replacing a built-in kind requires "
"`register_adapter_factory(kind, factory, override=True)` and is logged. "
"See [Backend Extensions](backend-extensions.md) for the startup and "
"deployment requirements."
msgstr ""
"把 `BACKEND_EXTENSIONS` 设为这个模块的导入名，并在模型注册表里使用 `kind: "
"example_service`。工厂接收路由的配置字典，返回一个 adapter。它在内置 provider 默认值生效之前运行，所以需要的 "
"profile 或路径默认值都得自己提供。重复注册会失败；要替换内置 kind，必须调用 "
"`register_adapter_factory(kind, factory, "
"override=True)`，并且会记一条日志。启动和部署方面的要求见[后端扩展](backend-extensions.md)。"

#: ../developer/provider-adapters.md:318
msgid "BaseAdapter API reference"
msgstr "BaseAdapter API 参考"

#: ../developer/provider-adapters.md:320
msgid ""
"All adapters inherit from `BaseAdapter` "
"(`apps/backend/serving/adapters/base.py`) and implement:"
msgstr ""
"所有 adapter 都继承自 "
"`BaseAdapter`（`apps/backend/serving/adapters/base.py`），并实现："

#: ../developer/provider-adapters.md:335
msgid "Utility methods provided by the base class:"
msgstr "基类提供的工具方法："

#: ../developer/provider-adapters.md:365
msgid "Available attributes:"
msgstr "可用的属性："

#: ../developer/provider-adapters.md:372
msgid "Advanced features"
msgstr "进阶功能"

#: ../developer/provider-adapters.md:374
msgid "Multi-modal support"
msgstr "多模态支持"

#: ../developer/provider-adapters.md:376
msgid "For models accepting images:"
msgstr "对于接受图像输入的模型："

#: ../developer/provider-adapters.md:382
msgid ""
"Handle the image content blocks in your adapter's `chat_completion`. A "
"route may declare narrower `input_modalities` than the model, so a text-"
"only fallback never receives media."
msgstr ""
"在 adapter 的 `chat_completion` 里处理图像内容块。单条路由可以声明比模型更窄的 "
"`input_modalities`，这样纯文本的回退路由就永远不会收到媒体内容。"

#: ../developer/provider-adapters.md:386
msgid "Tool / function calling"
msgstr "工具 / function calling"

#: ../developer/provider-adapters.md:392
msgid "Parse the provider's tool calls into OpenAI shape and pass them through:"
msgstr "把 provider 返回的工具调用解析成 OpenAI 的结构再透传出去："

#: ../developer/provider-adapters.md:414
msgid "Structured output (JSON mode)"
msgstr "结构化输出（JSON mode）"

#: ../developer/provider-adapters.md:420
msgid "Handle the `response_format` parameter:"
msgstr "处理 `response_format` 参数："

#: ../developer/provider-adapters.md:427
msgid "Limiting concurrent requests"
msgstr "限制并发请求"

#: ../developer/provider-adapters.md:429
msgid ""
"An adapter does not need its own limiter. The gateway already caps how "
"many requests it keeps open against each provider key, and lowers the cap"
" when the provider answers 429; see [Outbound concurrency](routing.md"
"#outbound-concurrency). A new adapter takes part by wrapping its upstream"
" call in a slot from `apps/backend/serving/adapters/upstream_limiter.py`,"
" as the built-in adapters do."
msgstr ""
"adapter 不需要自己做限流。网关已经限制了每个 provider key 同时在途的请求数，provider 返回 429 "
"时还会调低这个上限；见[出站并发](routing.md#outbound-concurrency)。新 adapter 只要像内置 "
"adapter 那样，把对上游的调用包在从 `apps/backend/serving/adapters/upstream_limiter.py`"
" 获取的槽位里，就能纳入这套机制。"

#: ../developer/provider-adapters.md:436
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "示例"

#: ../developer/provider-adapters.md:438
msgid ""
"**OpenAI-compatible provider.** DeepSeek has no adapter file. "
"`_make_adapter` in `apps/backend/serving/servers/registry.py` sets "
"`provider_profile = \"deepseek\"` and returns `OpenAICompatAdapter`; the "
"profile lives in `apps/backend/serving/adapters/profiles.py`."
msgstr ""
"**OpenAI 兼容的 provider**。DeepSeek 没有 adapter "
"文件。`apps/backend/serving/servers/registry.py` 里的 `_make_adapter` 设置 "
"`provider_profile = \"deepseek\"` 并返回 `OpenAICompatAdapter`；profile 本身在 "
"`apps/backend/serving/adapters/profiles.py`。"

#: ../developer/provider-adapters.md:442
msgid ""
"**Custom API format.** See `apps/backend/serving/adapters/gemini.py` for "
"message conversion against a non-OpenAI wire format."
msgstr ""
"**自定义 API 格式**。按非 OpenAI 协议格式转换消息的做法，可以参考 "
"`apps/backend/serving/adapters/gemini.py`。"

#: ../developer/provider-adapters.md:444
msgid ""
"**Local deployment.** vLLM and SGLang reuse "
"`apps/backend/serving/adapters/openai_compat.py`. The `vllm` and `sglang`"
" kinds dispatch to the same class; local-vs-remote behaviour comes from "
"`base_url` and the routing layer, not from a dedicated adapter."
msgstr ""
"**本地部署**。vLLM 和 SGLang 复用 "
"`apps/backend/serving/adapters/openai_compat.py`。`vllm` 和 `sglang` 这两个 "
"kind 分发到同一个类；本地与远程的行为差异来自 `base_url` 和路由层，而不是来自专门的 adapter。"

#: ../developer/provider-adapters.md:449
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排查"

#: ../developer/provider-adapters.md:451
msgid "Response format errors"
msgstr "响应格式错误"

#: ../developer/provider-adapters.md:453
msgid "Ensure `format_response()` returns the OpenAI-compatible structure."
msgstr "确保 `format_response()` 返回 OpenAI 兼容的结构。"

#: ../developer/provider-adapters.md:454
msgid "Validate that `UsageInfo` fields are integers."
msgstr "校验 `UsageInfo` 的各字段都是整数。"

#: ../developer/provider-adapters.md:455
msgid ""
"Check `finish_reason` is one of `stop`, `length`, `content_filter`, "
"`tool_calls`."
msgstr "检查 `finish_reason` 是 `stop`、`length`、`content_filter`、`tool_calls` 之一。"

#: ../developer/provider-adapters.md:457
msgid ""
"For streaming, emit the first non-empty content chunk as soon as it is "
"available so time-to-first-token is recorded accurately."
msgstr "流式场景下，第一个非空内容分片一可用就立刻发出，这样首 token 时延（time-to-first-token）才会被准确记录。"

#: ../developer/provider-adapters.md:460
msgid "Streaming issues"
msgstr "流式问题"

#: ../developer/provider-adapters.md:462
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Ensure chunks are SSE-formatted: `data: {json}\\n\\n`."
msgstr "确保分片是 SSE 格式：`data: {json}\\n\\n`。"

#: ../developer/provider-adapters.md:463
msgid "Send the final usage chunk before `data: [DONE]`."
msgstr "在 `data: [DONE]` 之前发送最后那个 usage 分片。"

#: ../developer/provider-adapters.md:464
msgid "Handle JSON parsing errors gracefully."
msgstr "妥善处理 JSON 解析错误。"

#: ../developer/provider-adapters.md:466
msgid "Best practices"
msgstr "最佳实践"

#: ../developer/provider-adapters.md:468
msgid ""
"**Error handling** — use `self.http.json_post_with_retry()` and surface "
"provider faults with useful messages."
msgstr "**错误处理**——使用 `self.http.json_post_with_retry()`；provider 出错时，要给出有用的错误信息。"

#: ../developer/provider-adapters.md:470
msgid ""
"**Usage accounting** — prefer provider-reported usage; fall back to "
"`estimate_prompt_tokens()` / `estimate_text_tokens()`."
msgstr ""
"**用量记账**——优先采用 provider 上报的 usage；拿不到再回退到 `estimate_prompt_tokens()` / "
"`estimate_text_tokens()`。"

#: ../developer/provider-adapters.md:472
msgid ""
"**Streaming helpers** — use `format_stream_chunk()`, "
"`make_final_usage_chunk()`, and `done_sentinel()` for consistent SSE."
msgstr ""
"**流式辅助函数**——用 `format_stream_chunk()`、`make_final_usage_chunk()` 和 "
"`done_sentinel()` 保证 SSE 输出一致。"

#: ../developer/provider-adapters.md:474
msgid ""
"**Type safety** — full type hints, and keep request/response shapes "
"aligned with `apps/backend/serving/schemas.py`."
msgstr "**类型安全**——写完整的类型标注，并让请求/响应的结构与 `apps/backend/serving/schemas.py` 保持一致。"

#: ../developer/provider-adapters.md:476
msgid ""
"**Testing** — exercise both streaming and non-streaming paths, and try "
"large prompts to validate token clamping."
msgstr "**测试**——流式和非流式两条路径都要测到，并用大 prompt 验证 token 数会被正确截断。"

#: ../developer/provider-adapters.md:478
msgid ""
"**Docs & style** — Google-style docstrings in English; keep provider-"
"specific logic out of shared code."
msgstr "**文档与风格**——用英文写 Google 风格的 docstring；不要把 provider 专属的逻辑塞进共享代码。"

#: ../developer/provider-adapters.md:480
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Secrets** — use `${ENV_VAR}` in YAML rather than hardcoding keys or "
"endpoints, and keep the values in `.env`."
msgstr "**密钥**——在 YAML 里用 `${ENV_VAR}`，不要硬编码 key 或端点，取值放在 `.env` 中。"

